ility itself was known to many the  major downside to this ability is that  if performed incorrectly it could cause  brain damage  7. accio TV remote too far away want an  edge in your sport than Akio is the  spell for you simply put accio aka the  summoning charm allows the Caster to  summon an object towards them with the  object Claire in the Caster's mind an  object in or out of their line of sight  could be summoned towards them this  ability may seem fairly innocuous  compared to some of the others on this  list but I bet you'd use it more than  anything else 6. horcrux creation Tampa  with the deepest Mysteries the source of  Life the essence of self only if  prepared for consequences of the most  extreme and dangerous kind a horcrux is  an object in which a dark ritual wizard  imparts a piece of their soul in order  to achieve immortality a horcrux can  only be created after committing an act  of murder and is considered to be the  most terrible form of dark magic charms  and jinxers are often put in plays to  further protect Hall cruxes after they  are created and the appeal of them is  that if your main physical form is  destroyed your sole existence lives on  in these objects  eternal life at your fingertips is  certainly incredibly powerful but I'd  imagine that most wouldn't want it which  is why it's lower down on the list 5.  invisibility have you ever been at the  grocery store and seen someone walk in  that you do not want to talk to when  you're out of the house and vulnerable  to unwanted conversation there always  seems to be someone lurking around I  can't be alone here well if you're  anything like me then this ability may  come in handy invisibility refers to the  ability to be unseen by others despite  actually being there there are a few  ways of going about this in Harry Potter  with the most known method being via the  invisibility cloak one of the three  Deathly Hallows but there is a way of  achieving this without any kind of  equipment 